select '[{"key":"fe.welcome","grp":"get_in","name":"Welcome to the crew","family":"fe.welcome","reentry":365,"why":"New members decide in the first few days whether the app is worth keeping. A welcome that shows the prize counter, then one nudge to book a cage if they haven''t been back, turns sign-ups into regulars.","research":"Welcome emails are the most-opened automated email (2-3x a normal campaign). Send right away, then one follow-up within the first week; stop as soon as they visit.","trigger_text":"Someone joins your app","timing_text":"Right away · day 4 if they haven''t been back","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"Points on every visit and every dollar (your point rules)","engine":"workflow","sort":1,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.signup","label":"Joins the app","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{}},{"id":"n2","type":"w.stop_on_convert","label":"Goal: checks in","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"goal":"checkin"}},{"id":"n3","type":"a.email","label":"Email: welcome","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"Right away","subject":"You''re in, {{first_name}}! Your {{business}} rewards are live","preheader":"Points on every visit, prizes at the counter.","heading":"Welcome to the crew, {{first_name}}","body":"Every visit and every dollar you spend earns points. Trade them at the prize counter for arcade credit, food, toys and cage time.\n\nShow your QR code at the counter each time you come in and your points stack up automatically.","cta_label":"See the prizes","cta_path":"/app/rewards","footnote":"Tip: show your QR code at the counter on every visit"}},{"id":"n4","type":"w.wait","label":"Wait 4 days","position":{"x":0,"y":420},"config":{"minutes":5760}},{"id":"n5","type":"c.since_entry","label":"Back yet?","position":{"x":0,"y":560},"config":{"events":["checkin.recorded","booking.created","booking.completed"]}},{"id":"n6","type":"w.exit","label":"End: came in","position":{"x":-300,"y":700},"config":{"reason":"converted"}},{"id":"n7","type":"a.email","label":"Email: book a cage","position":{"x":0,"y":700},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"Day 4, if they haven''t been in","subject":"Ready to play, {{first_name}}?","preheader":"Reserve a cage or a pool table so it''s ready when you walk in.","heading":"Grab a cage, bring a friend","body":"Reserve a batting cage or a pool table in the app and it''s waiting for you when you walk in.\n\nYour points start the moment you check in, and the first prizes are closer than you think.","cta_label":"Book a cage","cta_path":"/app/book"}},{"id":"n8","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":840},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null},{"id":"e_n3_n4","from":"n3","to":"n4","branch":null},{"id":"e_n4_n5","from":"n4","to":"n5","branch":null},{"id":"e_n5_n6_yes","from":"n5","to":"n6","branch":"yes"},{"id":"e_n5_n7_no","from":"n5","to":"n7","branch":"no"},{"id":"e_n7_n8","from":"n7","to":"n8","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.points_earned","grp":"rewards","name":"Points scoreboard","family":"fe.points_earned","reentry":7,"why":"After a visit or a purchase, players see their new score next to the prizes it gets them closer to. At most one a week, and never during the welcome week or right after an unlock email.","research":"Showing progress toward a goal (the goal-gradient effect) brings people back sooner; programs that send a balance update after earning see more redemptions than ones that stay quiet.","trigger_text":"Points are added (visit, purchase, review…)","timing_text":"2 hours later · max 1 a week","channels":["email"],"reward_text":null,"engine":"workflow","sort":2,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.points","label":"Points are added","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"min_balance":1,"entry_if":[{"type":"c.in_journey","config":{"key":"fe.welcome"},"negate":true}]}},{"id":"n2","type":"w.wait","label":"Wait 2 hours","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"minutes":120}},{"id":"n3","type":"c.in_journey","label":"Just unlocked a prize?","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{"key":"fe.reward_ready"}},{"id":"n4","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":-300,"y":420},"config":{}},{"id":"n5","type":"a.email","label":"Email: scoreboard","position":{"x":0,"y":420},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"2 hours after earning","subject":"Scoreboard update: {{points}} points, {{first_name}}","preheader":"Here''s what your points get you at {{business}}.","heading":"You''re at {{points}} points","body":"Nice playing. Here''s what your points can get you at the prize counter, and what''s up next.","cta_label":"Open the prize counter","cta_path":"/app/rewards"}},{"id":"n6","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":560},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null},{"id":"e_n3_n4_yes","from":"n3","to":"n4","branch":"yes"},{"id":"e_n3_n5_no","from":"n3","to":"n5","branch":"no"},{"id":"e_n5_n6","from":"n5","to":"n6","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.almost_there","grp":"rewards","name":"Almost there","family":"fe.almost_there","reentry":21,"why":"When a player gets within a quarter of their next prize, one email tells them exactly how close they are. A close goal is the best reason to come back this week.","research":"The goal-gradient effect: people speed up as a reward gets close (punch-card studies saw visits come faster near the last stamp). One nudge at about 75% is enough.","trigger_text":"Points reach 75% of the next prize","timing_text":"1 hour later · max 1 every 3 weeks","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"The next prize on their list","engine":"workflow","sort":3,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.event","label":"Close to the next prize","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"events":["reward.near"]}},{"id":"n2","type":"w.wait","label":"Wait 1 hour","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"minutes":60}},{"id":"n3","type":"c.in_journey","label":"Unlocked something meanwhile?","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{"key":"fe.reward_ready"}},{"id":"n4","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":-300,"y":420},"config":{}},{"id":"n5","type":"a.email","label":"Email: so close","position":{"x":0,"y":420},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"1 hour after","subject":"{{first_name}}, you''re {{points_remaining}} points from {{offer_name}}","preheader":"One more visit should do it.","heading":"So close: {{offer_name}}","body":"Just {{points_remaining}} more points and it''s yours. One more visit should do it: every check-in and every dollar at the counter adds up.","cta_label":"Plan my next visit","cta_path":"/app/book"}},{"id":"n6","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":560},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null},{"id":"e_n3_n4_yes","from":"n3","to":"n4","branch":"yes"},{"id":"e_n3_n5_no","from":"n3","to":"n5","branch":"no"},{"id":"e_n5_n6","from":"n5","to":"n6","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.reward_ready","grp":"rewards","name":"Prize unlocked","family":"fe.reward_ready","reentry":30,"why":"The moment a player''s points cross a prize''s cost they get a big photo email of it with a Redeem button. If they haven''t redeemed anything two weeks later, one reminder shows them what''s waiting.","research":"Unredeemed rewards are a ready-made reason to visit; a celebratory unlock message plus one reminder about two weeks later lifts redemption without feeling pushy.","trigger_text":"Points cross a prize''s cost","timing_text":"Right away · 14 days later if nothing redeemed","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"The prize they unlocked","engine":"workflow","sort":4,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"