:1,"why":"A prize a player already redeemed in the app but hasn''t picked up at the counter gets one email three days before it expires, so nothing goes to waste.","research":"Expiry reminders create natural urgency; an email a few days out leaves time to plan a visit, and the last-48-hours push catches the rest.","trigger_text":"A redeemed prize expires in 3 days","timing_text":"Checked daily · 3 days before","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"The prize they already redeemed","engine":"workflow","sort":5,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.event","label":"Prize expires in 3 days","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"events":["reward.expiring"]}},{"id":"n2","type":"a.email","label":"Email: pick it up","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"3 days before it expires","subject":"Your {{offer_name}} expires {{due_date}}","preheader":"Show your code at the counter before then.","heading":"Pick it up before {{due_date}}","body":"Your {{offer_name}} is saved in the app until {{due_date}}. Show your code at the counter on your next visit and it''s yours.","cta_label":"Show my code","cta_path":"/app/rewards"}},{"id":"n3","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.review","grp":"after_visit","name":"Google review for points","family":"fe.review","reentry":120,"why":"The day after a visit, while the fun is fresh, players who haven''t reviewed you get one ask with your review points. Then never again for 4 months. Points land when the desk verifies it.","research":"Review requests within a day of the visit get the best response; a single email ask beats repeated pushes, and more than two asks hurts goodwill.","trigger_text":"Someone checks in, no review yet","timing_text":"The next day · max 1 every 4 months","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"Your review points, added when the review is verified","engine":"workflow","sort":6,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.event","label":"Checked in, no review yet","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"events":["checkin.recorded"],"entry_if":[{"type":"c.feature","config":{"feature":"reviews"}},{"type":"c.reviewed","negate":true}]}},{"id":"n2","type":"w.wait","label":"Wait 1 day","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"minutes":1440}},{"id":"n3","type":"c.reviewed","label":"Already reviewed?","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{}},{"id":"n4","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":-300,"y":420},"config":{}},{"id":"n5","type":"a.email","label":"Email: review for points","position":{"x":0,"y":420},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"The day after the visit","bonus_from":"rule:review","subject":"Got 30 seconds? Get +{{bonus}} points","preheader":"A quick Google review, and the points are yours.","heading":"How was your visit?","body":"If you had fun at {{business}}, a quick Google review helps other families find us.\n\nOnce it''s verified we''ll add {{bonus}} points to your card.","cta_label":"Leave a review","cta_path":"/app/rewards?focus=review","footnote":"+{{bonus}} points when your review is verified"}},{"id":"n6","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":560},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null},{"id":"e_n3_n4_yes","from":"n3","to":"n4","branch":"yes"},{"id":"e_n3_n5_no","from":"n3","to":"n5","branch":"no"},{"id":"e_n5_n6","from":"n5","to":"n6","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.referral","grp":"after_visit","name":"Bring your crew","family":"fe.referral","reentry":90,"why":"Regulars are the best source of new players. From the third visit on, the day after a visit, they get one nudge to share their invite link. Both people get points.","research":"Referral asks work best right after a good time and with a two-sided reward; regulars (3+ visits) refer far more than first-timers.","trigger_text":"A check-in by someone with 3+ visits","timing_text":"The next day · max 1 every 3 months","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"Your referral points for both people","engine":"workflow","sort":7,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.event","label":"Regular checks in","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"events":["checkin.recorded"],"entry_if":[{"type":"c.feature","config":{"feature":"referrals"}},{"type":"c.visit_count","config":{"op":"gte","value":3}}]}},{"id":"n2","type":"w.wait","label":"Wait 1 day","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"minutes":1440}},{"id":"n3","type":"a.email","label":"Email: bring a friend","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"The day after","bonus_from":"rule:referral_referrer","subject":"Bring a friend, you both get points","preheader":"+{{bonus}} for you, +{{friend_bonus}} for them.","heading":"More players, more points","body":"Know someone who''d love {{business}}? Share your invite link from the app.\n\nWhen they join and check in, you get {{bonus}} points and they get {{friend_bonus}}.","cta_label":"Get my invite link","cta_path":"/app/rewards?focus=refer","footnote":"+{{bonus}} points for you, +{{friend_bonus}} for your friend"}},{"id":"n4","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":420},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null},{"id":"e_n3_n4","from":"n3","to":"n4","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.winback","grp":"come_back","name":"We miss you","family":"fe.winback","reentry":60,"why":"Players who haven''t been in for 45 days get a friendly email with their points, then a comeback bonus two weeks later if they still haven''t visited. The bonus only lands if they actually check in.","research":"Win-back works best as a short sequence with the incentive in the second touch and a clear deadline; for entertainment venues most regulars visit every 2-4 weeks, so 45 days is a real lapse.","trigger_text":"No visit in 45 days","timing_text":"Day 45 · day 59 with a bonus","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"+1,000 points if they check in within 2 weeks of the bonus email","engine":"workflow","sort":8,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.event","label":"No visit in 45 days","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"events":["inactivity.45"],"entry_if":[{"type":"c.booked_ahead","negate":true}]}},{"id":"n2","type":"a.email","label":"Email: we miss you","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"Day 45","subject":"The cages miss you, {{first_name}}","preheader":"Your {{points}} points are still here.","heading":"It''s been {{days_since_last_visit}} days!","body":"Your {{points}} points are still on your card, and the prize counter is stocked. Swing by for a round, a game or a slice.","cta_label":"Book a cage","cta_path":"/app/book"}},{"id":"n3","type":"w.wait","label":"Wait 14 days","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{"minutes":20160}},{"id":"n4","type":"c.since_entry","label":"Back or booked?","position":{"x":0,"y":420},"config":{"events":["checkin.recorded","booking.created","booking.completed"]}},{"id":"n5","type":"w.exit","label":"End: came back","position":{"x":-300,"y":560},"config":{"reason":"converted"}},{"id":"n6","type":"a.email","label":"Email: comeback bonus","position":{"x":0,"y":560},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"Day 59, if not back","bonus_from":"node:n8","subject":"A comeback bonus for you: +{{bonus}} points","preheader":"Check in within 2 weeks and they''re yours.","heading":"Come back, score +{{bonus}} points","body":"Check in at {{business}} in the next 2 weeks and we''ll add {{bonus}} bonus points to your card, on top of everything you earn that day.","cta_label":"Plan my visit","cta_path":"/app/book","footnote":"+{{bonus}} bonus points when you check in within 14 days"}},{"id":"n7","type":"w.until","label":"Checked in within 2 weeks?","position":{"x":0,"y":700},"config":{"timeout_minutes":20160,"condition":{"type":"c.since_entry","config":{"events":["checkin.recorded","booking.completed"]}}}},{"id":"n8","type":"a.points","label":"Award +1,000 points","position":{"x":-300,"y":840},"config":{"points":1000,"note":"Comeback bonus"}},{"id":"n9","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":840},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null},{"id":"e_n3_n4","from":"n3","to":"n4","branch":null},{"id":"e_n4_n5_yes","from":"n4","to":"n5","branch":"yes"},{"id":"e_n4_n6_no","from":"n4","to":"n6","branch":"no"},{"id":"e_n6_n7","from":"n6","to":"n7","branch":null},{"id":"e_n7_n8_yes","from":"n7","to":"n8","branch":"yes"},{"id":"e_n7_n9_no","from":"n7","to":"n9","branch":"no"},{"id":"e_n8_n5","from":"n8","to":"n5","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.party_planner","grp":"celebrate","name":"Birthday party planner","family":"fe.party","reentry":300,"why":"Three weeks before a member''s birthday they get one email inviting them to throw the party with you. Party bookings are your biggest tickets, and weekends fill early.","research":"Most birthday parties are booked 2-4 weeks ahead; an invitation in that window, before they pick a venue, is the single most valuable message an entertainment center sends.","trigger_text":"A member''s birthday is 3 weeks away","timing_text":"21 days before · checked daily","channels":["email"],"reward_text":null,"engine":"workflow","sort":9,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.event","label":"Birthday in 3 weeks","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"events":["birthday.soon"],"entry_if":[{"type":"c.booked_ahead","negate":true}]}},{"id":"n2","type":"a.email","label":"Email: party invite","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"21 days before the birthday","subject":"{{first_name}}, your birthday''s coming up 🎂","preheader":"Party room, cages, arcade and pizza. We''ll handle the fun.","heading":"Party at {{business}}?","body":"Your birthday is about 3 weeks away. Party room, batting cages, arcade and pizza: we handle the fun, you bring the crew.\n\nWeekends go fast, so grab your spot early.","cta_label":"Plan my party","cta_path":"/app/book?section=party"}},{"id":"n3","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","branch":null}]}},{"key":"fe.birthday","grp":"celebrate","name":"Happy birthday","family":"fe.birthday","reentry":300,"why":"On their birthday, members get a birthday email with their points and prizes. Your birthday gift offer (if you have one) still arrives in the app as before.","research":"Birthday emails have some of the highest open and redemption rates of any automated email.","trigger_text":"The member''s birthday","timing_text":"On the day (morning, local time)","channels":["email"],"reward_text":"Your birthday gift offer, if you have one","engine":"workflow","sort":10,"niche":"entertainment","graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"t.event","label":"Birthday","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"config":{"events":["birthday"]}},{"id":"n2","type":"a.email","label":"Email: happy birthday","position":{"x":0,"y":140},"config":{"template":"arcade","gated":true,"gate":"venue","when":"On the day","subject":"Happy birthday, {{first_name}}! 🎉","preheader":"Come celebrate with us this week.","heading":"Happy birthday from {{business}}!","body":"Come celebrate with us this week. Your points are waiting, and so is the prize counter.","cta_label":"See my prizes","cta_path":"/app/rewards"}},{"id":"n3","type":"w.exit","label":"End","position":{"x":0,"y":280},"config":{}}],"edges":[{"id":"e_n1_n2","from":"n1","to":"n2","branch":null},{"id":"e_n2_n3","from":"n2","to":"n3","br